Childish Gambino got a lot of buzz for his “For The Internet” album – and all of it was well deserved! Walking on the fine line between r&b and hip-hop it’s among the strongest albums of the year! Moreover, Donald Glover is set to play on the smaller festival stage on Summer Jam this year too! Looking forward to it!

